  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Momcozy Official | V1 Wearable Breast Pump | Compact & Portable & Hospital Grade | Momcozy Hospital Grade Breast Pump - V1 | Compact & Portable & Hospital Grade & High Efficiency | Features micro-vibration technology, helps stimulate milk flow to make pumping easier. | Double-sealed skin-friendly flange ensures a comfy fit while preventing leakage",
